## 1. Hardware & System Specifications

| Component | Specification |
| :--- | :--- |
| **SoC** | Broadcom BCM2836 (v1.1) / BCM2837 (v1.2) |
| **CPU** | Quad-core ARM Cortex-A7 @ 900 MHz (ARMv7-A 32-bit) |
| **GPU** | Broadcom VideoCore IV Dual-Core @ 250 MHz |
| **RAM** | 1 GB LPDDR2 SDRAM (shared with GPU) |
| **Storage** | MicroSD slot (UHS-1 supported) |
| **Networking** | 10/100 Mbps Ethernet (SMSC LAN9514 USB/NIC Controller) |
| **Serial Console** | PL011 UART / Mini UART on 40-pin GPIO Header (Pins 6, 8, 10) |
| **Yocto Release** | `scarthgap` (5.0 LTS) |
| **Target Machine** | `raspberrypi2` |

