## 4. Environment Initialization

Source the OpenEmbedded build environment initialization script. This sets up required `PATH` variables, BitBake scripts, and creates the `build/` directory.

```bash
cd ~/rpi-yocto
source poky/oe-init-build-env build
```

> **Note:** Whenever you open a new terminal session, rerun `cd ~/rpi-yocto && source poky/oe-init-build-env build` to reactivate the BitBake environment.

