## 5. BitBake Layer & Build Configuration

### 5.1 Layer Registration (`bblayers.conf`)

Add the required BSP and helper layers to your build configuration:

```bash
bitbake-layers add-layer ../poky/meta-raspberrypi
bitbake-layers add-layer ../poky/meta-openembedded/meta-oe
bitbake-layers add-layer ../poky/meta-openembedded/meta-python
bitbake-layers add-layer ../poky/meta-openembedded/meta-networking
```

Verify the active layer list:

```bash
bitbake-layers show-layers
```

### 5.2 Target Tuning & Safeguards (`local.conf`)

Edit `conf/local.conf` to configure the target architecture, hardware UART, init system, package management, and disk safeguards:

```bitbake
# ==============================================================================
# Hardware Machine Target
# ==============================================================================
MACHINE = "raspberrypi2"
ENABLE_UART = "1"
RPI_USE_U_BOOT = "0"
GPU_MEM = "64"

# ==============================================================================
# Init System Configuration (Systemd)
# ==============================================================================
DISTRO_FEATURES:append = " systemd"
VIRTUAL-RUNTIME_init_manager = "systemd"
DISTRO_FEATURES_BACKFILL_CONSIDERED = "sysvinit"
VIRTUAL-RUNTIME_initscripts = ""

# ==============================================================================
# Package Format & Package Management
# ==============================================================================
PACKAGE_CLASSES = "package_ipk"
EXTRA_IMAGE_FEATURES ?= "debug-tweaks package-management ssh-server-dropbear"

# ==============================================================================
# Performance & Resource Management Safeguards
# ==============================================================================
# Automatically purge build artifacts to conserve disk space
INHERIT += "rm_work"

# Set parallel execution limits based on host CPU cores and RAM
BB_NUMBER_THREADS = "4"
PARALLEL_MAKE = "-j 4"

# Disk monitoring: pause or abort builds before host storage exhaustion
BB_DISKMON_DIRS = "\
    STOPTASKS,${TMPDIR},1G,100K \
    STOPTASKS,${DL_DIR},1G,100K \
    STOPTASKS,${SSTATE_DIR},1G,100K \
    ABORT,${TMPDIR},100M,1K \
    ABORT,${DL_DIR},100M,1K"
```

