## 6. Image Compilation & Target Options

Select and build the desired image target:

### Minimal Headless Production Image (Recommended)
```bash
bitbake core-image-minimal
```

### Full-Featured Headless System
Includes complete command-line tools, networking utilities, and package manager:
```bash
bitbake core-image-full-cmdline
